        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N4Bmz3xSSiI3S_5XBV12I-C4HXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/146246-sauteed-sweet-plantains-ddfsm-step-1-5811-99480e8361e341e7a70277401cd4023b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/146246/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently toss plantain slices with brown sugar, then place into hot oil. Fry until plantains begin to turn golden brown, then turn over, and continue frying until caramelized, about 2 minutes per side.",
